 *	@cmap: frame buffer colormap structure
 *	@len: length of @cmap
 *	@transp: boolean, 1 if there is transparency, 0 otherwise
 *	@flags: flags for kmalloc memory allocation
 *
 *	Allocates memory for a colormap @cmap.  @len is the
